WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.677
SET UP. Place labelled maize and bean seeds on damp cotton.

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.840
COMPARE. Show a second labelled container with dry cotton.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.284
OBSERVE. Depict root and shoot appearing after suitable days.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:16.850
RECORD. Put daily observations in two side-by-side charts.
